
## 🎯 Features

### Core Capabilities
- **Real-time Power Flow Widget** - Live solar, grid, battery, consumption visualization
- **Cost Savings Calculator** - Daily/weekly/monthly/yearly savings + CO₂ reduction
- **Automations List** - Smart energy recommendations
- **Multi-tenant Login** - Client-specific dashboards
- **REST + WebSocket APIs** - Real-time updates

### Data Sources (MVP → Production Path)
| Source | MVP | Production |
|--------|-----|-------------|
| Mock Data | ✅ | - |
| Home Assistant | - | REST API bridge |
| Fronius Inverter | - | API parser |
| SMA Inverter | - | API parser |
| Shelly EM | - | API integration |

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|-------|------------|
| Frontend | React 18, Vite, TailwindCSS, Recharts |
| Backend | Node.js, Express, WebSocket (ws) |
| Database | SQLite (MVP) → PostgreSQL (Production) |
| Real-time | WebSocket |
| API Protocol | REST + WebSocket |

## 🚦 Quick Start (Without Docker)

### Prerequisites
- Node.js 18+ or 20+
- npm or yarn

### Installation & Run

```bash
# 1. Install backend dependencies
cd backend
npm install

# 2. Start backend server (port 5000)
npm run dev

# 3. In new terminal, install frontend dependencies
cd frontend
npm install

# 4. Start frontend dev server (port 5173)
npm run dev